+}
+/* D-11: from 640 px wide on the phone layout (the Fold open, the Duo stacked, portrait iPads) the top bar is one row,
+   as in landscape: the company name stays whole and the search box gives way first, the badge keeps "● Oct 16" (its
+   sheet has the rest); under 760 px the beta site's logo goes as in landscape (the Beta tag stays, and the line above
+   the chart and the tab's title say "melon·seek"), and the view switch's tabs are tighter. */
+@media (min-width: 640px) and (max-width: 860px) {
